# This repository runs with `core.autocrlf=true` and has no repository-root
# `.gitattributes`, so a fresh worktree otherwise receives CRLF and changes every
# byte this crate's gates read. Six sibling crates already carry this file —
# `grapt-api`, `-event`, `-policy`, `-provider`, `-schema` and `-service` — and
# `grapt-api`'s header records what its absence cost there: a fresh
# default-config clone reported 107 passed / 1 failed against 108 / 0 on an LF
# one, same commit, same toolchain, same machine.
#
# `grapt-runtime` had none, and is the only crate in the workspace carrying an
# `include_str!` source gate WITHOUT an attributes file. That gap is not latent
# here — it is red right now, and has been for every lane that ran the suite on
# Windows:
#
#   * `tests/attempt_tool_durable_boundary.rs` reads `src/tool_protocol.rs`
#     through `include_str!` and matches literals that contain `\n`. On a CRLF
#     checkout those literals can never match, so
#     `artifact_capture_precedes_terminal_artifact_construction` and
#     `public_authorized_entry_consumes_the_owned_lease_before_continuation`
#     fail for a reason that has nothing to do with the laws they assert. They
#     are two of the three pre-existing failures every recent receipt in this
#     campaign has had to disclose and step around.
#
# That is worse than a false red. Those two are the CLOSEST existing analogue to
# what L4 must witness, so without this file L4's own witnesses would be born
# failing on this machine and it would have no green baseline to compare against.
# The lane after this one is the reason it is being fixed now rather than later.
#
# It also means these gates assert exact source text: any reformat or move of
# `tool_protocol.rs` breaks them, and this attribute is what makes that a real
# signal rather than an artifact of who cloned the repository.
#
# Verified before landing: all 77 tracked files under this crate already hold LF
# in the index (`git ls-files --eol` reports `i/lf` for every one), so these
# rules pin the CHECKOUT and change no stored content.
src/** text eol=lf
tests/** text eol=lf
mutations/** text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
